# Architect product principles

Canonical text: `apps/architect/PRODUCT_PRINCIPLES.md` (DO NOT REMOVE).

When working in `apps/architect`, these override individual `MISSION*.md` prompts:

1. Architect is consulting intelligence — not software/codegen-first.
2. Every feature must improve business understanding.
3. Everything derives from evidence — no fake scores or invented workflows.
4. Never ask unnecessary questions — senior consultant, not survey.
5. One evolving Business Blueprint is the source of truth.
6. Multi-tenant first — isolated, namespaced, permission-aware.
7. White-label by design.
8. Continuous consulting — institutional memory never "finishes."
9. Human-first — assist judgment; explain recommendations; show evidence and confidence.
10. Architect is the front door; other products execute.

Work **one task at a time** unless the user asks otherwise.
